---
interface Props {
  minimal?: boolean;
}

const { minimal = false } = Astro.props;
---

<footer class:list={['footer-shell relative z-20', minimal ? 'mt-0' : 'mt-16']}>
  <div
    class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-4 py-8 sm:px-6"
    style="padding-left: max(1rem, env(safe-area-inset-left)); padding-right: max(1rem, env(safe-area-inset-right));"
  >
    <nav class="footer-site-nav" aria-label="页脚导航">
      <a href="/">首页</a>
      <span class="footer-site-nav__dot" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <a href="/about/">关于本站</a>
      <span class="footer-site-nav__dot" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <a href="/tips/">戒烟小技巧</a>
    </nav>
    <p class="mt-5 text-center text-sm leading-relaxed text-theme-muted">
      本站内容为健康科普，不能替代医生诊疗。紧急情况请拨打当地急救电话。
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-center text-xs text-theme-faint">© {new Date().getFullYear()} 吸烟危害与戒烟科普</p>
  </div>
</footer>
